      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, are you sure? I was looking through the logs earlier and saw some weird timing issues in the auth service during the load tests. It looked like some tokens were getting rejected even though the credentials were right. Can you double check the concurrency and race condition stuff specifically? I don't want us getting paged at 3am on Saturday because of a threading issue.",
